{"title":"COFFEE AND A CHAT AT THE  PICKLE BARREL  2300 YONGE STREET","startsAt":"2026-11-09T14:00:00-05:00","endsAt":"2026-11-09T16:00:00-05:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"**THIS WILL BA A BI-WEEKLY EVENT TO CHAT, LAUGH, AND GET TO KNO**W EACH OTHER. NO PRESSURE TO ATTEND - JUST VISIT OR DROP IN...(members only please) ***Be kind and rsvp so that the host knows how many seats to book.***\n\n**Anyone that is not a member will be asked politely to leave and apply to TSSC if they so choose.**\n\nBring yourself and your sense of humor. The group can decide it's own agenda of chat after a few meetups. I know it is difficult NOT to talk about politics or religion, but we are a social group whose premise is fun! As tempting as it can be, please restrain and stick to topics less heated.\n\n**OVER THE COOLER MONTHS WE WILL BE HAVING THE C&C AT THE PICKLE BARREL ONCE A MONTH BEGINNING SEPTEMBER 23.**","venue":{"name":"Pickle Barrel Grand, 2300 Yonge Street (Upper Level)","address":"2300 Yonge Street, Upper Level (NW Corner of Yonge & Eglinton), Toronto","lat":43.653225,"lng":-79.38319,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Toronto Seniors Social Club","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/a/3/c/2/highres_522401922.jpeg"}